{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/label1.gif?t=1744812946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Uncover the mysteries of a lost civilization</strong> in this creature-collecting adventure. <strong>Inscribe your findings</strong> into a bestiary\u2014a tome with the forgotten lore of Yselion and its creatures. With every entry, you draw closer to the truth behind the fallen empire and the Beasts that roam its ruins. Hatch, train, and forge deep bonds with unique Beasts as you face the <strong>legendary Star Trials\u2014only the fittest will endure.</strong><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/label_1.gif?t=1744812946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/label2.gif?t=1744812946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Raise over\u00a0100 Fully Animated Beasts, </strong>train them and as you guide their evolution into <strong>powerful paragons.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/gif_2_2.gif?t=1744812946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Beast follows a unique path, shaped by your choices and raising. Will your companion become a <strong>ruthless Tyrant, a noble Monarch, or a cunning Archon? Every Adult Beast can be ridden!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/label_2.gif?t=1744812946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/label3.gif?t=1744812946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture into an untamed, open world <strong>teeming with secrets and lurking dangers</strong>. <strong>Chart your own path</strong>\u00a0riding your Beasts through perilous landscapes, but beware\u2014one wrong step could bring you face to face with <strong>something far more dangerous than you ever imagined</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/label_3.gif?t=1744812946\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/label4.gif?t=1744812946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beasts are more than just companions\u2014they are <strong>part of an eternal cycle</strong>. As they pass away, the power they've acquired lives on, stored within mysterious orbs that can be absorbed by other Beasts. Through this <strong>endless flow of hearts and souls</strong>, the next generation grows ever stronger. <strong>Death is not the end\u2014it is only the next step in their journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/label_4.gif?t=1744812946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Demo will be ready soon. Add Astra Bestiary to your wishlist and follow so you don't miss out!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3529090?t=1744812946","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744812946","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/e915eb354dd127331045a378d7ddc3e0b7983db4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744812946","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/e915eb354dd127331045a378d7ddc3e0b7983db4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744812946","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/label1.gif?t=1744812946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Uncover the mysteries of a lost civilization</strong> in this creature-collecting adventure. <strong>Inscribe your findings</strong> into a bestiary\u2014a tome with the forgotten lore of Yselion and its creatures. With every entry, you draw closer to the truth behind the fallen empire and the Beasts that roam its ruins. Hatch, train, and forge deep bonds with unique Beasts as you face the <strong>legendary Star Trials\u2014only the fittest will endure.</strong><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/label_1.gif?t=1744812946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/label2.gif?t=1744812946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Raise over\u00a0100 Fully Animated Beasts, </strong>train them and as you guide their evolution into <strong>powerful paragons.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/gif_2_2.gif?t=1744812946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Beast follows a unique path, shaped by your choices and raising. Will your companion become a <strong>ruthless Tyrant, a noble Monarch, or a cunning Archon? Every Adult Beast can be ridden!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/label_2.gif?t=1744812946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/label3.gif?t=1744812946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture into an untamed, open world <strong>teeming with secrets and lurking dangers</strong>. <strong>Chart your own path</strong>\u00a0riding your Beasts through perilous landscapes, but beware\u2014one wrong step could bring you face to face with <strong>something far more dangerous than you ever imagined</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/label_3.gif?t=1744812946\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/label4.gif?t=1744812946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beasts are more than just companions\u2014they are <strong>part of an eternal cycle</strong>. As they pass away, the power they've acquired lives on, stored within mysterious orbs that can be absorbed by other Beasts. Through this <strong>endless flow of hearts and souls</strong>, the next generation grows ever stronger. <strong>Death is not the end\u2014it is only the next step in their journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/label_4.gif?t=1744812946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Demo will be ready soon. Add Astra Bestiary to your wishlist and follow so you don't miss out!</p>","developers":["Bicho Feo"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/7073a54814c357cf42c389f812ff6455ba2f916a/header.jpg?t=1744812946","is_free":false,"linux_requirement